</div></div></div><div style='background: #fdfefe; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px;'><p style='margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: bold;'><span class='question-badge'>25</span> 25. According to Edward, Olyset nets are better than other nets because they</p><input type='hidden' id='ans-25' value=''><div class='option-group' data-question='25'><div class='option-item' data-value='A'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>A</strong> remain effective for longer.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='B'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>B</strong> use a greater number of chemicals.</span></div><div class='option-item' data-value='C'><span class='option-radio'></span><span class='option-text'><strong>C</strong> give protection against more types of insects.</span></div></div></div></div><div style='background-color: #f1f2f6; border-left: 5px solid #fab1a0; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px;'><strong style='display: block; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 5px;'>Questions 26-30</strong><span style='font-size: 0.9rem; color: #57606f;'>Complete the flow-chart below. Choose <strong>FIVE</strong> answers from the box and write the correct letter, <strong>A-G</strong>, next to questions 26-30.</span></div><div style='background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e4e7eb; padding: 25px; border-radius: 10px; line-height: 1.8;'><div style='background: #f8f9fa; border: 1px solid #e1e8ed; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 25px;'><h4 style='margin-top: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e1e8ed; padding-bottom: 8px; color: #e67e22; text-align: center;'>Options Box</h4><div style='display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; padding-left: 10px; font-weight: 500;'><div><strong>A</strong> workforce</div><div><strong>B</strong> sources of funding</div><div><strong>C</strong> investment opportunities</div><div><strong>D</strong> unique fe